      "summary": "Central London shoppers reveal what they love to splash out on - and share their tips for not overspending.",
      "body": "Up Next. Watch: Stargazers around the world glimpse 'Blood Moon' lunar eclipse. Video, 00:01:04SubsectionScience & EnvironmentPublished16 hours agoTracing the deadly path of the Nepal-Tibet flash flood. Video, 00:02:01SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoWorker films moment he escapes deadly Nepal floods. Video, 00:00:51SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoWhat caused the Nepal-Tibet flash floods? Video, 00:00:59SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoBBC visits hospital in Kathmandu as families wait for news. Video, 00:01:55SubsectionAsiaPublished2 days agoHow Dolly Parton became a fashion icon. Video, 00:01:12SubsectionCulturePublished2 days agoAerial footage shows flash flood on Nepal-Tibet border. Video, 00:00:34SubsectionAsiaPublished2 days agoDolly Parton: The life of an iconic country singer. Video, 00:00:10SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoIs UK's Storm Shadow missile a game changer for Ukraine? Video, 00:01:37SubsectionEuropePublished4 days agoRobot boxing, football and sprinting at World Humanoid Games. Video, 00:01:24SubsectionAsiaPublished5 days agoWatch: Moment humanoid robot beats Usain Bolt's 100m record. Video, 00:00:46SubsectionAsiaPublished6 days ago",
