      "summary": "https://xcancel.com\n\"On Monday 24th August at 8PM EST, we received at letter from X Corp. asking to cease and desist the service XCancel.\nThe service XCancel is stopped until further notice.\nWe are seeking legal advice and won't share more details for now.\nThank you for the trust you have put in these two years of XCancel.\"\nhttps://nitter.net\n\"On 24 August 2026 cease and desist letters have been s",
      "body": "XCancel and Nitter are receiving C&D letters from XCorp77 points by mobilio 2 hours ago  | hide | past | favorite | 26 commentshttps://xcancel.com\n\"On Monday 24th August at 8PM EST, we received at letter from X Corp. asking to cease and desist the service XCancel.\nThe service XCancel is stopped until further notice.\nWe are seeking legal advice and won't share more details for now.\nThank you for the trust you have put in these two years of XCancel.\"https://nitter.net\n\"On 24 August 2026 cease and desist letters have been sent by X Corp. demanding a permanent takedown of Nitter instances and the project's repository.nitter.net is offline and development has stopped for the time being. I'm seeking legal advice and won't be commenting further on the specifics for now.Thank you to everyone who used, hosted, packaged, donated and contributed to Nitter over the past seven years.\" help\nGuidelines | FAQ | Lists | API | Security | Legal | Apply to YC | Contact",
