      "summary": "Look back at her greatest moments with hits such as Jolene, 9 to 5 and Islands in the Stream",
      "body": "Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food         Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live             Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food        Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live         Close menu\nA-ZTV GuideWatchlistHomeDolly Parton at the BBCDolly Parton at the BBCA look back at some of Dolly Parton's finest performances at the BBC, incorporating her greatest moments and hits such as Jolene, 9 to 5, Islands in the Stream and Here You Come Again. Duration59 minsFirst shown8:30pm 22 Jan 2022Available for 27 daysAudio DescribedSign LanguageMore Like ThisMore Like This EpisodesCreating an icon. How a girl from the Smoky Mountains conquered Nashville – and the worldGeorge Clooney directs the true tale of a gutsy crew going for gold at the 1936 OlympicsRadiohead deliver an epic, all-time great Glastonbury set in 1997.Starring Al Pacino as an army veteran who has lost his sight, but not his lust for lifeA spell-binding studio session from 1995 with Stevie at his sublime, soulful bestMotown Master: Lamont Dozier at the BBCA songwriting legend. Celebrating the man who helped create the unique Motown soundClaire McCollum celebrates long-lasting partnerships and how faith sustains them.With Showaddywaddy, Dana, Thin Lizzy, Bob Marley and the Wailers, and Boney M.John Wilson’s American Greats. Gershwin, Copeland and more in a glittering programmeWith The Miracles, The Supremes, Stevie Wonder, The Temptations and The Four Tops.Shining moments. The first lady of soul, from The Supremes to supreme solo starMahjooba Nowrouzi on the challenges of reporting from Afghanistan.",
