    {
      "id": "bbc-2026-08-22-video-appears-to-show-police-chase-minutes-before-fatal-a66-",
      "title": "Video appears to show police chase minutes before fatal A66 crash",
      "summary": "Several police vehicles are seen chasing a car just three minutes before the crash on the A66 near Middlesbrough.",
      "body": "Security camera footage appears to show several police vehicles chasing a car just minutes before a fatal crash that killed seven people, including two police officers, near Middlesbrough.The clip is thought to have been filmed on Lime Road at 03:36 BST on Saturday morning, around three minutes before a Volkswagen Passat travelling the wrong way on the A66 nearby collided into a marked police vehicle.The BBC understands the police car involved in the crash was not part of the pursuit and that the chase had stopped before the collision.Following a mandatory referral from Cleveland Police, the Independent Office for Police Conduct (IOPC) has opened an investigation into the circumstances of the crash.More on this story",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "world",
      "tags": [],
